"Benéton is known for design-led, award-winning developments: Rhombus Bangsar (FIABCI Malaysia Building of the Year 2014; PAM Gold 2013), Stonor Park (FIABCI 2007), 2Hampshire KLCC (PAM 2008) and Irama Wangsa (EdgeProp-ILAM Sustainable Landscape Gold 2021), alongside Menara Chan, Prestij Kota Damansara and Bangsar Peak.": "Benéton terkenal dengan pembangunan berteraskan reka bentuk yang memenangi anugerah: Rhombus Bangsar (FIABCI Malaysia Building of the Year 2014; PAM Gold 2013), Stonor Park (FIABCI 2007), 2Hampshire KLCC (PAM 2008) dan Irama Wangsa (EdgeProp-ILAM Sustainable Landscape Gold 2021), di samping Menara Chan, Prestij Kota Damansara dan Bangsar Peak.",
"Head office: Level 18, Menara Chan, 138 Jalan Ampang, 50450 Kuala Lumpur · 03-2715 1166 · www.benetonproperties.com": "Ibu pejabat: Level 18, Menara Chan, 138 Jalan Ampang, 50450 Kuala Lumpur · 03-2715 1166 · www.benetonproperties.com",
