"<0>Distinctive World Sdn Bhd</0>, the developer of TuJu Residences &amp; Retail at KL Duta North, is a joint venture between Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd, a member of Distinctive Group, and Eccaz Sdn Bhd.": "<0>Distinctive World Sdn Bhd</0>, pemaju TuJu Residences &amp; Retail di KL Duta North, ialah usaha sama antara Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd, ahli Distinctive Group, dan Eccaz Sdn Bhd.",
"<0>Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd</0> was founded by Dato’ Dr. David Koh and Mr. Lim Ech Chan in 2012 to tap into the property market in Johor, where the Group has successfully completed two projects, namely 1Tebrau and Iskandar Residences. Dato’ Dr. David Koh, through KLS Property Sdn Bhd, is also an active participant in the Klang Valley property market, with projects including Klang Utama Township in Klang, Bukit Kiara Residence and Eden Jalil, two luxurious landed residential projects in Bukit Jalil; and Vista Damai Residences, a high-rise residential development in KL City.": "<0>Distinctive Capital Sdn Bhd</0> diasaskan oleh Dato’ Dr. David Koh dan Encik Lim Ech Chan pada 2012 untuk menceburi pasaran hartanah di Johor, di mana Kumpulan ini telah berjaya menyiapkan dua projek, iaitu 1Tebrau dan Iskandar Residences. Dato’ Dr. David Koh, melalui KLS Property Sdn Bhd, juga aktif dalam pasaran hartanah Lembah Klang dengan projek termasuk Klang Utama Township di Klang, Bukit Kiara Residence dan Eden Jalil, dua projek kediaman bertanah mewah di Bukit Jalil; serta Vista Damai Residences, pembangunan kediaman bertingkat tinggi di pusat bandar KL.",
"Distinctive Group has also ventured into the Australian property market, with completed and ongoing projects in Perth, Australia, including its latest developments, Ora @ Sorrento and Serai @ Fremantle.": "Distinctive Group juga telah menceburi pasaran hartanah Australia, dengan projek yang telah siap dan sedang dijalankan di Perth, Australia, termasuk pembangunan terbaharunya, Ora @ Sorrento dan Serai @ Fremantle.",
"<0>Eccaz Sdn Bhd</0> was founded to venture into the property development and urban transportation businesses.": "<0>Eccaz Sdn Bhd</0> ditubuhkan untuk menceburi perniagaan pembangunan hartanah dan pengangkutan bandar.",
"Eccaz is helmed by Ms. Monica Lai and Mr. Chan Chee Kian, who were respectively the Group Deputy Managing Director, and Executive Director of Ireka Corporation Berhad (ICB). Both are instrumental in development of ICB’s property arm and the development of its many notable high-end residential, commercial and hospitality projects in Kuala Lumpur. Among them are Seni Mont Kiara, KiaraVille, One Mont Kiara, The RuMa Hotel &amp; Residences and the Aloft Hotel at KL Sentral.": "Eccaz diterajui oleh Cik Monica Lai dan Encik Chan Chee Kian, yang masing-masing pernah menjadi Timbalan Pengarah Urusan Kumpulan dan Pengarah Eksekutif Ireka Corporation Berhad (ICB). Kedua-duanya memainkan peranan penting dalam membangunkan cabang hartanah ICB serta banyak projek kediaman, komersial dan hospitaliti mewah yang terkenal di Kuala Lumpur. Antaranya ialah Seni Mont Kiara, KiaraVille, One Mont Kiara, The RuMa Hotel &amp; Residences dan Aloft Hotel di KL Sentral.",
"Level 31, Menara 1MK, Kompleks 1 Mont' Kiara, Premier Suite, No. 1, Jalan Kiara, Mont' Kiara, 50480 Kuala Lumpur.": "Level 31, Menara 1MK, Kompleks 1 Mont' Kiara, Premier Suite, No. 1, Jalan Kiara, Mont' Kiara, 50480 Kuala Lumpur.",
