"How <0>e-Enquiry Works</0>": "Cara <0>e-⁠Enquiry Berfungsi</0>",
"iNewProject helps you find new-launch properties in Malaysia, enquire about the exact unit you want, and get rewarded when you buy on selected projects. It's free for buyers.": "iNewProject membantu anda mencari hartanah baharu di Malaysia, bertanya terus tentang unit yang anda mahu, dan menerima ganjaran apabila membeli di projek terpilih. Percuma untuk pembeli.",
"STEP 1": "LANGKAH 1",
"Browse new launches": "Lihat projek baharu",
"See each project's prices, layouts, floor plans, location and developer in one place.": "Lihat harga, susun atur, pelan lantai, lokasi dan pemaju setiap projek di satu tempat.",
"STEP 2": "LANGKAH 2",
"Choose your unit": "Pilih unit anda",
"On projects open for e-Enquiry, pick your tower or phase, then the level or row (depending on the property type) and your unit. Check its size, layout and listed price.": "Bagi projek yang dibuka untuk e-⁠Enquiry, pilih menara atau fasa, kemudian tingkat atau baris (bergantung pada jenis hartanah) dan unit anda. Semak keluasan, susun atur dan harga yang disenaraikan.",
"STEP 3": "LANGKAH 3",
"Submit an e-Enquiry": "Hantar e-⁠Enquiry",
"Send your e-Enquiry in a minute and receive an e-Enquiry Reference ID. An e-Enquiry is an enquiry only. It is not a booking or a reservation, and you don't pay anything to iNewProject.": "Hantar e-⁠Enquiry anda dalam seminit dan terima ID Rujukan e-⁠Enquiry. e-⁠Enquiry hanyalah pertanyaan. Ia bukan tempahan atau simpanan unit, dan anda tidak membayar apa-apa kepada iNewProject.",
"STEP 4": "LANGKAH 4",
"Or speak with the developer's sales representative first": "Atau berbual dahulu dengan wakil jualan pemaju",
"Not ready to choose a unit? Use <0>Speak With Sales Representative</0> on the project page to ask a question first.": "Belum bersedia memilih unit? Gunakan <0>Bercakap Dengan Wakil Jualan</0> di halaman projek untuk bertanya dahulu.",
"Either way, the developer's sales representative for that project will contact you to confirm availability, the latest price and promotions, arrange a viewing and guide you through your purchase.": "Walau apa pun pilihan anda, wakil jualan pemaju bagi projek itu akan menghubungi anda untuk mengesahkan unit yang masih ada, harga dan promosi terkini, mengatur lawatan dan membantu anda sepanjang proses pembelian.",
"STEP 5": "LANGKAH 5",
"Sign your SPA and claim your reward": "Tandatangan SPA dan tuntut ganjaran anda",
"On projects that show an e-Enquiry reward, eligible buyers receive one reward for each signed and verified Sale and Purchase Agreement (SPA). The reward is funded by iNewProject, not the developer. You need an iNewProject member account before you buy, so register early, ideally before you submit your e-Enquiry.": "Bagi projek yang memaparkan ganjaran e-⁠Enquiry, pembeli yang layak menerima satu ganjaran bagi setiap Perjanjian Jual Beli (SPA) yang ditandatangani dan disahkan. Ganjaran ini dibiayai oleh iNewProject, bukan pemaju. Anda perlu ada akaun ahli iNewProject sebelum membeli, jadi daftar awal — sebaik-baiknya sebelum anda hantar e-⁠Enquiry.",
"Full conditions: <0>e-Enquiry Rewards Terms &amp; Conditions</0>.": "Syarat penuh: <0>Terma &amp; Syarat Ganjaran e-⁠Enquiry</0>.",
"Common questions": "Soalan lazim",
"<0>Do I pay anything?</0><1/> No. Browsing, enquiring and claiming an eligible reward are free.": "<0>Perlukah saya membayar apa-apa?</0><1/> Tidak. Melihat projek, bertanya dan menuntut ganjaran yang layak semuanya percuma.",
"<0>Do I need an account?</0><1/> Not to enquire. To be eligible for a reward you need a member account before you buy, so it's best to register before you submit your e-Enquiry.": "<0>Perlukah saya ada akaun?</0><1/> Tidak untuk bertanya. Untuk layak menerima ganjaran, anda perlu ada akaun ahli sebelum membeli, jadi sebaiknya daftar sebelum anda hantar e-⁠Enquiry.",
"<0>How do I see the e-Enquiries I have made?</0><1/> Log in to your iNewProject member account. Every e-Enquiry you submit while logged in is listed in your member dashboard. If you enquired without an account, keep the e-Enquiry Reference ID you received.": "<0>Bagaimana saya boleh lihat e-⁠Enquiry yang telah saya buat?</0><1/> Log masuk ke akaun ahli iNewProject anda. Setiap e-⁠Enquiry yang anda hantar semasa log masuk disenaraikan dalam papan pemuka ahli anda. Jika anda bertanya tanpa akaun, simpan ID Rujukan e-⁠Enquiry yang anda terima.",
"<0>Who confirms my unit and price?</0><1/> The developer's sales representative. Availability, prices and promotions can change until your SPA is signed.": "<0>Siapa yang mengesahkan unit dan harga saya?</0><1/> Wakil jualan pemaju. Status unit, harga dan promosi boleh berubah sehingga SPA anda ditandatangani.",
"<0>How is my information used?</0><1/> We share your enquiry with the developer and its sales representative for that project so they can assist you. See our <2>Privacy Policy</2>.": "<0>Bagaimana maklumat saya digunakan?</0><1/> Kami berkongsi pertanyaan anda dengan pemaju dan wakil jualannya bagi projek tersebut supaya mereka boleh membantu anda. Lihat <2>Dasar Privasi</2> kami.",
