"About Alaia Titiwangsa @ Kuala Lumpur": "Tentang Alaia Titiwangsa @ Kuala Lumpur",
"<0>ALAIA Titiwangsa</0> introduces a refreshing interpretation of urban living in the heart of Kuala Lumpur, bringing together contemporary residences, meaningful community spaces and the privacy of an established residential enclave. Set within Taman Tiara Titiwangsa, the development offers residents the convenience of city connectivity while maintaining a more peaceful and intimate living environment away from the intensity of the city centre.": "<0>ALAIA Titiwangsa</0> membawa wajah baharu kehidupan bandar di tengah-tengah Kuala Lumpur — menggabungkan kediaman kontemporari, ruang komuniti yang bermakna dan privasi sebuah kawasan perumahan yang sudah mantap. Terletak di Taman Tiara Titiwangsa, pembangunan ini memberi penghuni kemudahan akses bandar, sambil mengekalkan suasana yang lebih tenang dan intim, jauh dari kesibukan pusat bandar.",
"Designed around the concept of urban community living, ALAIA goes beyond the conventional high-rise experience. Residents are surrounded by thoughtfully curated spaces for work, wellness, recreation and social connection — from co-working areas and the Social Hub to landscaped gardens, leisure facilities and elevated lifestyle spaces across the development.": "Direka berasaskan konsep kehidupan komuniti bandar, ALAIA menawarkan lebih daripada pengalaman kediaman bertingkat tinggi biasa. Penghuni dikelilingi ruang yang dirancang teliti untuk bekerja, kesejahteraan, rekreasi dan bersosial — daripada ruang kerja bersama dan Social Hub hingga taman berlandskap, kemudahan riadah dan ruang gaya hidup di aras tinggi di seluruh pembangunan.",
"One of ALAIA’s defining features is its panoramic setting. Selected residences enjoy expansive views towards either Kuala Lumpur’s iconic skyline — including KLCC, TRX, Merdeka 118 and KL Tower — or the greenery of the Titiwangsa Range and Genting Highlands beyond. Clear glass balcony railings are incorporated to preserve these uninterrupted views from within the home.": "Antara keistimewaan utama ALAIA ialah pemandangan panoramanya. Unit terpilih menikmati pemandangan luas sama ada ke arah latar langit ikonik Kuala Lumpur — termasuk KLCC, TRX, Merdeka 118 dan Menara KL — atau kehijauan Banjaran Titiwangsa dan Tanah Tinggi Genting di kejauhan. Pagar balkoni kaca jernih digunakan supaya pemandangan ini tidak terhalang dari dalam rumah.",
"The development comprises 436 residences across 40 storeys, complemented by 18 retail shops and a collection of 28 lifestyle facilities. Residential layouts range from approximately 635 sq. ft. to 1,012 sq. ft., providing options suited to different urban lifestyles.": "Pembangunan ini mempunyai 436 kediaman setinggi 40 tingkat, dilengkapi 18 kedai runcit dan 28 kemudahan gaya hidup. Susun atur kediaman antara kira-kira 635 kaki persegi hingga 1,012 kaki persegi, dengan pilihan yang sesuai untuk pelbagai gaya hidup bandar.",
"Connectivity further strengthens ALAIA’s appeal. The development is approximately 1 km from dedicated access to the DUKE Highway, around 3 km from the Titiwangsa LRT/MRT interchange and approximately 8 km from major destinations such as KLCC and Bukit Bintang.": "Akses yang mudah menambah lagi daya tarikan ALAIA. Pembangunan ini terletak kira-kira 1 km dari laluan khas ke Lebuhraya DUKE, kira-kira 3 km dari stesen pertukaran LRT/MRT Titiwangsa dan kira-kira 8 km dari destinasi utama seperti KLCC dan Bukit Bintang.",
"ALAIA Titiwangsa is ultimately designed as more than a residence. It is a contemporary urban community where residents can live privately, connect naturally and enjoy Kuala Lumpur from a distinctive vantage point.": "ALAIA Titiwangsa direka lebih daripada sekadar kediaman. Ia sebuah komuniti bandar kontemporari — tempat penghuni boleh hidup dengan privasi, berhubung secara semula jadi dan menikmati Kuala Lumpur dari sudut pandangan yang tersendiri.",
"1.6 Acres": "1.6 Ekar",
"Set on approximately 1.6 acres in Taman Tiara Titiwangsa, ALAIA Titiwangsa is a 40-storey serviced apartment development comprising 436 residential units and 18 retail shops. The development is designed around a community-centric living concept, combining private residences with a wide range of shared social, recreational and lifestyle spaces. <0/> <1/> Residents enjoy 28 facilities distributed across multiple levels, including landscaped recreational areas, co-working and meeting spaces, a Social Hub, Sky Gym, Yoga and Pilates Garden, 25-metre Sky Pool, Sky Jacuzzi, sauna, Sky Dining, Sky Lounge and Sky Cinema &amp; BBQ Deck. Residential layouts range from approximately 635 sq. ft. to 1,012 sq. ft., with selected homes enjoying panoramic views towards either Kuala Lumpur’s city skyline or the Titiwangsa Range.": "Terletak di atas kira-kira 1.6 ekar di Taman Tiara Titiwangsa, ALAIA Titiwangsa ialah pembangunan pangsapuri servis 40 tingkat dengan 436 unit kediaman dan 18 kedai runcit. Pembangunan ini direka berasaskan konsep kehidupan berpusatkan komuniti, menggabungkan kediaman peribadi dengan pelbagai ruang sosial, rekreasi dan gaya hidup yang dikongsi bersama. <0/> <1/> Penghuni menikmati 28 kemudahan di beberapa aras, termasuk kawasan rekreasi berlandskap, ruang kerja bersama dan bilik mesyuarat, Social Hub, Sky Gym, Taman Yoga dan Pilates, Sky Pool 25 meter, Sky Jacuzzi, sauna, Sky Dining, Sky Lounge serta Sky Cinema &amp; BBQ Deck. Susun atur kediaman antara kira-kira 635 kaki persegi hingga 1,012 kaki persegi, dengan unit terpilih menikmati pemandangan panorama ke arah latar langit Kuala Lumpur atau Banjaran Titiwangsa.",
