"ALAIA Titiwangsa is developed by <0>Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd.</0> and presented under the <1>Windsor Collection</1>, a property portfolio associated with Multifield International Holdings Ltd. According to the official brochure, the wider group has experience across property investment and development in the Asia-Pacific region, with a portfolio spanning luxury residences, office towers, corporate housing, serviced apartments and villas.": "ALAIA Titiwangsa dibangunkan oleh <0>Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd.</0> dan diperkenalkan di bawah <1>Windsor Collection</1>, portfolio hartanah yang dikaitkan dengan Multifield International Holdings Ltd. Menurut brosur rasmi, kumpulan ini berpengalaman dalam pelaburan dan pembangunan hartanah di rantau Asia Pasifik, dengan portfolio merangkumi kediaman mewah, menara pejabat, perumahan korporat, pangsapuri servis dan vila.",
"Through the Windsor Collection, the developer positions its projects around carefully planned living environments, contemporary design and long-term residential quality. For ALAIA Titiwangsa, Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd. is the registered developer, with its office at Naza Tower, Platinum Park, Kuala Lumpur.": "Melalui Windsor Collection, pemaju menumpukan projeknya pada persekitaran kediaman yang dirancang teliti, reka bentuk kontemporari dan kualiti kediaman jangka panjang. Bagi ALAIA Titiwangsa, Black Lotus Development Sdn. Bhd. ialah pemaju berdaftar, dengan pejabatnya di Naza Tower, Platinum Park, Kuala Lumpur.",
