"Anja Residence is developed by Gan Sin Poo &amp; Sons Sdn. Bhd. (102722-P), which builds under the Villamas brand and works from Villamas's head office at Plaza TTDI, Taman Tun Dr Ismail, Kuala Lumpur. The company is a licensed housing developer whose first housing permits, for Bukit Kepong Baru, date from 2002. Anja is registered with the Ministry of Housing and Local Government as Pangsapuri Anja.": "Anja Residence dibangunkan oleh Gan Sin Poo &amp; Sons Sdn. Bhd. (102722-P), yang membina di bawah jenama Villamas dan beroperasi dari ibu pejabat Villamas di Plaza TTDI, Taman Tun Dr Ismail, Kuala Lumpur. Syarikat ini ialah pemaju perumahan berlesen, dan permit perumahan pertamanya, bagi Bukit Kepong Baru, bermula pada 2002. Anja didaftarkan dengan Kementerian Pembangunan Kerajaan Tempatan (KPKT) sebagai Pangsapuri Anja.",
"Villamas says it has more than 20 years of experience completing projects, including Verve @ Ara Damansara, Zefer Hill and Atmosfera in Puchong, as well as developments in Kepong, Serdang, Bukit Jalil and Cyberjaya. Its current mixed development, Meta_City in Seri Kembangan, is also where the Anja Residence property gallery is, at Pusat Perniagaan Atmosphere, Bandar Putra Permai.": "Villamas menyatakan ia mempunyai lebih 20 tahun pengalaman menyiapkan projek, termasuk Verve @ Ara Damansara, Zefer Hill dan Atmosfera di Puchong, serta pembangunan di Kepong, Serdang, Bukit Jalil dan Cyberjaya. Pembangunan bercampurnya kini, Meta_City di Seri Kembangan, juga menempatkan galeri hartanah Anja Residence, di Pusat Perniagaan Atmosphere, Bandar Putra Permai.",
"No B-2-6 Plaza TTDI, Jalan Wan Kadir 3, Taman Tun Dr Ismail, 60000 Kuala Lumpur": "No B-2-6 Plaza TTDI, Jalan Wan Kadir 3, Taman Tun Dr Ismail, 60000 Kuala Lumpur",
