"About Breeze Hill Shoppes": "Tentang Breeze Hill Shoppes",
"Every day, a steady stream of visitors winds up the mountain road through Gohtong Jaya on the way to Genting Highlands — one of Malaysia's most-visited leisure destinations. They stop for breakfast before the climb, for coffee on the way down, for supplies, souvenirs and a night out. Breeze Hill Shoppes puts your business directly on that route: a new retail address rising within the Tropicana Windcity masterplan, about 3 km from Genting Highlands Premium Outlets, where highland footfall meets a growing resident community.": "Setiap hari, pengunjung tidak putus-putus mendaki jalan gunung melalui Gohtong Jaya menuju ke Tanah Tinggi Genting — antara destinasi riadah paling popular di Malaysia. Mereka singgah untuk sarapan sebelum naik, minum kopi dalam perjalanan turun, membeli barang keperluan, cenderamata dan bersantai pada waktu malam. Breeze Hill Shoppes meletakkan perniagaan anda betul-betul di laluan itu: alamat runcit baharu yang sedang dibina dalam pelan induk Tropicana Windcity, kira-kira 3 km dari Genting Highlands Premium Outlets, tempat kunjungan pelancong tanah tinggi bertemu komuniti penduduk yang semakin bertambah.",
"The Shoppes offers 90 freehold, individually strata-titled retail lots from 959 to 3,470 sq ft, spread across Ground and Upper Ground zones that follow the natural slope of the hill. Lots are designed the way retailers actually trade — wide shopfronts for visibility, ceilings from 12 feet, natural light and ventilation, and al fresco frontage, double frontage and column-free layouts on selected lots. A dedicated three-level Shoppes car park and three drop-off zones bring customers to the door, while public washrooms, a surau, seating areas, landscaping, security and cleaning are maintained under a single management body — so the whole destination stays presentable, not just your unit.": "The Shoppes menawarkan 90 lot runcit pegangan bebas dengan hakmilik strata individu, seluas 959 hingga 3,470 kaki persegi, di zon Ground dan Upper Ground yang mengikut cerun semula jadi bukit. Lot-lot direka mengikut cara peniaga sebenarnya berniaga — muka kedai lebar supaya mudah dilihat, siling dari 12 kaki, cahaya dan pengudaraan semula jadi, serta ruang al fresco di hadapan, dua muka kedai dan susun atur tanpa tiang bagi lot terpilih. Tempat letak kereta khas Shoppes setinggi tiga aras dan tiga zon menurunkan penumpang membawa pelanggan terus ke pintu kedai, manakala tandas awam, surau, tempat duduk, landskap, keselamatan dan kebersihan diuruskan oleh satu badan pengurusan — supaya seluruh destinasi kekal kemas, bukan sahaja unit anda.",
"There's a place here for almost every trade. Zones near the entrance carry upgraded 100A three-phase power for F&amp;B operators running serious kitchens — restaurants, grocers, convenience-with-café concepts — while main-road frontage suits cafés, bistros and dessert franchises. A self-contained entertainment floor is planned for karaoke, family edutainment, claw-machine and VR concepts, and further lots suit wellness, beauty, laundry, gadgets and everyday services. Directly above it all: the development's two service-apartment towers — 1,722 homes of built-in, walk-down custom.": "Hampir setiap jenis perniagaan ada tempatnya di sini. Zon berhampiran pintu masuk dilengkapi bekalan elektrik tiga fasa 100A yang dinaik taraf untuk pengusaha F&amp;B dengan dapur sebenar — restoran, kedai runcit makanan, konsep kedai serbaneka dengan kafe — manakala lot di tepi jalan utama sesuai untuk kafe, bistro dan francais pencuci mulut. Satu tingkat hiburan tersendiri dirancang untuk karaoke, edutainmen keluarga, mesin cakar dan konsep VR, dan lot lain sesuai untuk kesejahteraan, kecantikan, dobi, gajet dan perkhidmatan harian. Betul-betul di atas semuanya: dua menara pangsapuri servis pembangunan ini — 1,722 rumah, pelanggan sedia ada yang hanya perlu turun ke bawah.",
"Breeze Hill Shoppes is developed by Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd., a member of the Tropicana Corporation Berhad group (established 1979). Where Gohtong Jaya's retail has long meant traditional individually-titled shoplots, the Shoppes introduces a managed, stratified retail destination — a new category for the town, arriving alongside its next wave of residents. Enquire for the full lot list, floor plans and zone specifications.": "Breeze Hill Shoppes dibangunkan oleh Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd., ahli kumpulan Tropicana Corporation Berhad (ditubuhkan pada 1979). Jika runcit di Gohtong Jaya selama ini bermaksud lot kedai tradisional berhakmilik individu, The Shoppes memperkenalkan destinasi runcit strata yang diurus — kategori baharu untuk pekan ini, hadir seiring gelombang penduduk baharunya. Buat pertanyaan untuk senarai lot penuh, pelan lantai dan spesifikasi zon.",
"Site Plan Overview — Retail Zones &amp; Directions": "Gambaran Pelan Tapak — Zon Runcit &amp; Arah",
"6.76 Acres": "6.76 Ekar",
"Set across 6.76 acres of freehold land in Gohtong Jaya, Breeze Hill Shoppes is the retail component of Breeze Hill, an integrated highland development by Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd.<0/> <1/> The Shoppes is a two-storey strata retail component of 90 freehold lots ranging from 959 to 3,470 sq ft, arranged across a Ground level and an Upper Ground level that steps with the natural slope of the site. Lots are served by a dedicated three-level Shoppes car park, three drop-off areas, and shared facilities under a single management body, including public washrooms, a surau, public seating, landscaping, security and cleaning.<2/> <3/> Where Gohtong Jaya's established retail is largely traditional shoplots, the Shoppes offers stratified retail lots with wide shopfronts, ceiling heights from 12 feet, and al fresco frontage to selected lots. Layouts are sized for F&amp;B and cafes, convenience and services, wellness and beauty, and lifestyle and entertainment operators. The development sits within Tropicana Windcity, approximately 3 km from Genting Highlands Premium Outlets, and adjoins the 1,722-unit Breeze Hill serviced apartments.": "Terletak di atas 6.76 ekar tanah pegangan bebas di Gohtong Jaya, Breeze Hill Shoppes ialah komponen runcit Breeze Hill, pembangunan bersepadu tanah tinggi oleh Tropicana Makmur Cahaya Sdn. Bhd.<0/> <1/> The Shoppes ialah komponen runcit strata dua tingkat dengan 90 lot pegangan bebas seluas 959 hingga 3,470 kaki persegi, disusun di aras Ground dan Upper Ground yang mengikut cerun semula jadi tapak. Lot-lot ini disokong oleh tempat letak kereta khas Shoppes setinggi tiga aras, tiga kawasan menurunkan penumpang, dan kemudahan bersama di bawah satu badan pengurusan, termasuk tandas awam, surau, tempat duduk awam, landskap, keselamatan dan kebersihan.<2/> <3/> Jika runcit sedia ada di Gohtong Jaya kebanyakannya lot kedai tradisional, The Shoppes menawarkan lot runcit strata dengan muka kedai yang lebar, siling dari 12 kaki, dan ruang al fresco di hadapan bagi lot terpilih. Susun atur disediakan untuk pengusaha F&amp;B dan kafe, kedai serbaneka dan perkhidmatan, kesejahteraan dan kecantikan, serta gaya hidup dan hiburan. Pembangunan ini terletak dalam Tropicana Windcity, kira-kira 3 km dari Genting Highlands Premium Outlets, dan bersebelahan pangsapuri servis Breeze Hill dengan 1,722 unit.",
