"Homecity Realty Sdn Bhd (Co. No. 201101018838 / 946971-P) is a Kajang-based property developer and the flagship of Homecity Group, which has been building in the Kajang–Semenyih corridor since 2001. The group is ISO 9001 certified, and its landed work has been recognised with a StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) recognition and a Sin Chew Business Excellence Award in 2020.": "Homecity Realty Sdn Bhd (No. Syarikat 201101018838 / 946971-P) ialah pemaju hartanah yang berpangkalan di Kajang dan syarikat utama Homecity Group, yang telah membangun di koridor Kajang–Semenyih sejak 2001. Kumpulan ini memiliki pensijilan ISO 9001, dan projek rumah bertanahnya telah diiktiraf melalui StarProperty Awards 2021 kategori Starter Home (Landed Excellence) serta Sin Chew Business Excellence Award pada 2020.",
"Homecity Realty completed Taman Ara Bayu in Mantin, a 97-home terrace scheme that received its Certificate of Completion and Compliance in January 2025, and the group is currently delivering Taman Ara Bayu 2 through sister company PFA Land Sdn Bhd. I.MAs Industrial joins 963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun as the group's move into industrial property on its home ground in Semenyih, applying two decades of local building experience to premises designed for business owners.": "Homecity Realty telah menyiapkan Taman Ara Bayu di Mantin, skim 97 rumah teres yang menerima Perakuan Siap dan Pematuhan pada Januari 2025, dan kumpulan ini kini sedang membangunkan Taman Ara Bayu 2 melalui syarikat sekutunya, PFA Land Sdn Bhd. I.MAs Industrial menyertai 963 Industrial Park @ Sungai Purun sebagai langkah kumpulan ke dalam hartanah perindustrian di kawasan asalnya di Semenyih, membawa dua dekad pengalaman membina di kawasan ini ke premis yang direka untuk pemilik perniagaan.",
