"About Irama Wangsa @ Wangsa Maju": "Tentang Irama Wangsa @ Wangsa Maju",
"Irama Wangsa is a freehold hillpark condominium in Seksyen 10, Wangsa Maju, developed by World Finder Resources Sdn Bhd, a member of the Benéton Properties Group. Completed in July 2018 with its Certificate of Completion and Compliance issued and individual strata titles in hand, the development places just 655 homes on 9 acres of elevated land — three towers of 25 and 26 storeys — with almost half the site, a 4-acre private hill park, kept as green space for residents.": "Irama Wangsa ialah kondominium taman bukit pegangan bebas di Seksyen 10, Wangsa Maju, dibangunkan oleh World Finder Resources Sdn Bhd, ahli Benéton Properties Group. Siap pada Julai 2018 dengan Perakuan Siap dan Pematuhan telah dikeluarkan dan hakmilik strata individu sudah tersedia, pembangunan ini hanya mempunyai 655 kediaman di atas 9 ekar tanah tinggi — tiga menara setinggi 25 dan 26 tingkat — dengan hampir separuh tapak, iaitu taman bukit persendirian seluas 4 ekar, dikekalkan sebagai kawasan hijau untuk penduduk.",
"The hill park is the heart of the address: a multi-level jungle-trail jogging track winds up the slope to a tree house lookout, and a bridge links the greenery directly to the resort deck on Level 6 — a 50-metre Olympic-length freeform pool, water play park, fully equipped gymnasium and an indoor badminton hall within the 10,000 sq ft clubhouse. A kindergarten, surau, retail lots and the management office sit within the grounds, while each tower greets residents with a grand drop-off lobby, three-tier security access and a visitor-management mobile app. The landscape earned Irama Wangsa a Gold at the EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021.": "Taman bukit ialah nadi kediaman ini: trek joging denai hutan berbilang aras berliku mendaki cerun ke tempat tinjau rumah pokok, dan sebuah jambatan menghubungkan kehijauan terus ke dek peranginan di Tingkat 6 — kolam renang bebas bentuk sepanjang 50 meter (panjang Olimpik), taman permainan air, gimnasium lengkap dan dewan badminton tertutup dalam rumah kelab seluas 10,000 kaki persegi. Tadika, surau, lot runcit dan pejabat pengurusan terletak dalam kawasan, manakala setiap menara menyambut penduduk dengan lobi menurunkan penumpang yang megah, akses keselamatan tiga peringkat dan aplikasi mudah alih pengurusan pelawat. Landskapnya memenangi Anugerah Emas di EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021.",
"Homes span seven practical family layouts from 991 sq ft (2+1 bedrooms) to 1,637 sq ft, each with a balcony framing either the city skyline or the hill park, laminated-floor bedrooms, tiled living and wet areas, and generous parking — most units come with two car park bays.": "Terdapat tujuh susun atur keluarga yang praktikal, dari 991 kaki persegi (2+1 bilik tidur) hingga 1,637 kaki persegi, setiap satu dengan balkoni menghadap latar langit bandar atau taman bukit, bilik tidur berlantai laminasi, ruang tamu dan kawasan basah berjubin, serta tempat letak kereta yang mencukupi — kebanyakan unit disertakan dua petak letak kereta.",
"Wangsa Maju keeps daily life close: Wangsa Walk Mall, AEON BIG and the Setapak retail belt minutes away, reputable schools and universities in the neighbourhood, and quick access to the DUKE, MRR2 and AKLEH highways — with a residents’ shuttle to Sri Rampai LRT station, six stops from KLCC. As a completed and individually-titled development, the final developer units are move-in ready, from RM550,000.": "Di Wangsa Maju, semua keperluan harian dekat: Wangsa Walk Mall, AEON BIG dan jalur beli-belah Setapak hanya beberapa minit, sekolah dan universiti terkenal di kawasan sekitar, serta akses pantas ke lebuhraya DUKE, MRR2 dan AKLEH — dengan bas ulang-alik penduduk ke stesen LRT Sri Rampai, enam stesen dari KLCC. Sebagai pembangunan yang telah siap dengan hakmilik individu, unit terakhir pemaju sedia untuk didiami, dari RM550,000.",
"9 Acres": "9 Ekar",
"The master plan hands almost half the land back to nature: of the 9-acre freehold parcel on a natural rise in Seksyen 10 Wangsa Maju, the built footprint is kept compact so that a 4-acre private hill park survives intact along the southern and eastern boundary — a gazetted-feeling forest garden that belongs to the 655 households alone.": "Pelan induk ini memulangkan hampir separuh tanah kepada alam semula jadi: daripada 9 ekar tanah pegangan bebas di atas bukit semula jadi di Seksyen 10 Wangsa Maju, kawasan binaan dikekalkan padat supaya taman bukit persendirian seluas 4 ekar kekal utuh di sepanjang sempadan selatan dan timur — taman hutan yang terasa seperti kawasan terpelihara, milik 655 isi rumah sahaja.",
"Three towers frame the central resort deck. Blocks A and B stand to the north, Block C to the south, and between them sits the freeform 50-metre swimming pool with its wading and children’s pools, pool decks and seating deck, the clubhouse complex with its multipurpose hall, surau and changing rooms, a barbecue area and playground. From the deck, a green bridge crosses into the hill park where the jungle walk switchbacks up the slope to a tree house lookout — the landscape that won the project a Gold at the EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021.": "Tiga menara mengelilingi dek peranginan di tengah. Blok A dan B di utara, Blok C di selatan, dan di antaranya terletak kolam renang bebas bentuk 50 meter bersama kolam cetek dan kolam kanak-kanak, dek kolam dan dek tempat duduk, kompleks rumah kelab dengan dewan serba guna, surau dan bilik persalinan, kawasan barbeku serta taman permainan. Dari dek, jambatan hijau merentasi ke taman bukit, di mana denai hutan berliku mendaki cerun ke tempat tinjau rumah pokok — landskap yang memenangi Anugerah Emas di EdgeProp–ILAM Malaysia’s Sustainable Landscape Awards 2021.",
"The estate runs on a single guarded main entrance with a signature tree at the arrival court and a dedicated drop-off porte-cochère at each tower, backed by three-tier security access. Completed in July 2018 with CCC and strata titles issued, the plan’s low density — 655 homes on 9 acres — is what keeps Irama Wangsa feeling like a hillside resort rather than a high-rise estate.": "Kawasan ini mempunyai satu pintu masuk utama berkawal dengan pokok ikonik di laman ketibaan dan anjung menurunkan penumpang khas di setiap menara, disokong akses keselamatan tiga peringkat. Siap pada Julai 2018 dengan CCC dan hakmilik strata telah dikeluarkan, kepadatan rendahnya — 655 kediaman di atas 9 ekar — menjadikan Irama Wangsa terasa seperti resort di lereng bukit, bukan kawasan bangunan tinggi.",
