"K Residence was developed by KL Landmark Sdn Bhd, a subsidiary of Olympia Industries Berhad. Olympia Industries and DutaLand Berhad are sister companies under the same controlling shareholder, and DutaLand presents K Residence among its affiliated projects. The tower was built above Avenue K, the Jalan Ampang shopping mall owned by the same group, and was completed in 2008.": "K Residence dibangunkan oleh KL Landmark Sdn Bhd, anak syarikat Olympia Industries Berhad. Olympia Industries dan DutaLand Berhad ialah syarikat bersaudara di bawah pemegang saham pengawal yang sama, dan DutaLand menyenaraikan K Residence sebagai antara projek bersekutunya. Menara ini dibina di atas Avenue K, pusat membeli-belah di Jalan Ampang milik kumpulan yang sama, dan siap pada 2008.",
"DutaLand Berhad has been listed on Bursa Malaysia since 1973 and was renamed from Mycom Berhad in 2007. Its property business spans Kuala Lumpur and Negeri Sembilan. In Kuala Lumpur, it developed KH Villa, a Sri Hartamas enclave of four-storey town villas designed with Kengo Kuma &amp; Associates and completed in 2011. In Seremban, its subsidiary Oakland Holdings has been developing the Oakland commercial area since the early 1990s, including the completed Oakland Square and the Oakland Ninety2 shop offices now under construction.": "DutaLand Berhad tersenarai di Bursa Malaysia sejak 1973 dan ditukar nama daripada Mycom Berhad pada 2007. Perniagaan hartanahnya meliputi Kuala Lumpur dan Negeri Sembilan. Di Kuala Lumpur, ia membangunkan KH Villa, kejiranan eksklusif vila bandar empat tingkat di Sri Hartamas yang direka bersama Kengo Kuma &amp; Associates dan siap pada 2011. Di Seremban, anak syarikatnya Oakland Holdings telah membangunkan kawasan komersial Oakland sejak awal 1990-an, termasuk Oakland Square yang telah siap dan kedai pejabat Oakland Ninety2 yang kini dalam pembinaan.",
