"Skypark Kepler is developed by Lido Waterfront Boulevard Sdn. Bhd. (471389-X), a Tropicana Corporation Berhad company and the licensed housing developer for the Lido Waterfront Boulevard land off Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan, Johor Bahru. The company, formerly known as Central Malaysian Properties Sdn. Bhd., is registered at Tropicana's head office in Tropicana Gardens Office Tower, Petaling Jaya, and runs the Lido Waterfront Boulevard Property Gallery in Teluk Danga.": "Skypark Kepler dibangunkan oleh Lido Waterfront Boulevard Sdn. Bhd. (471389-X), syarikat di bawah Tropicana Corporation Berhad dan pemaju perumahan berlesen bagi tanah Lido Waterfront Boulevard di Persiaran Abu Bakar Sultan, Johor Bahru. Syarikat ini, dahulunya dikenali sebagai Central Malaysian Properties Sdn. Bhd., berdaftar di ibu pejabat Tropicana di Tropicana Gardens Office Tower, Petaling Jaya, dan mengendalikan Lido Waterfront Boulevard Property Gallery di Teluk Danga.",
"Tropicana Corporation Berhad is a property group listed on Bursa Malaysia. Founded in 1979, it is known for resort-style communities such as Tropicana Golf &amp; Country Resort, Tropicana Indah and Tropicana City in the Klang Valley, and Tropicana Danga Bay in Johor. For Skypark Kepler, Tropicana works with Singapore-based Banyan Group, which plays a dual role as collaborator and management company, and with Samsung and Kohler on the homes' appliances and sanitary ware. Construction began after the groundbreaking with China State Construction Engineering Corporation in October 2024.": "Tropicana Corporation Berhad ialah kumpulan hartanah yang tersenarai di Bursa Malaysia. Diasaskan pada 1979, ia terkenal dengan komuniti bergaya resort seperti Tropicana Golf &amp; Country Resort, Tropicana Indah dan Tropicana City di Lembah Klang, serta Tropicana Danga Bay di Johor. Bagi Skypark Kepler, Tropicana bekerjasama dengan Banyan Group dari Singapura, yang memainkan dua peranan sebagai rakan kolaborasi dan syarikat pengurusan, serta dengan Samsung dan Kohler bagi peralatan dan kelengkapan sanitari kediaman. Pembinaan bermula selepas majlis pecah tanah bersama China State Construction Engineering Corporation pada Oktober 2024.",
