"About Oakland Ninety2": "Tentang Oakland Ninety2",
"Own your business address in Seremban 2. Oakland Ninety2 is a new row of 92 freehold shop offices on Jalan Haruan 5/9 in Oakland, next to the completed Oakland Square. Each unit has its own individual commercial title, so you own the land and the whole building rather than a strata share.": "Miliki alamat perniagaan anda sendiri di Seremban 2. Oakland Ninety2 ialah sederet 92 kedai pejabat pegangan bebas baharu di Jalan Haruan 5/9, Oakland, bersebelahan Oakland Square yang telah siap. Setiap unit mempunyai hakmilik komersial individu sendiri, jadi anda memiliki tanah dan seluruh bangunan, bukan sekadar bahagian strata.",
"Choose the size that fits your business. The 53 two-storey units (2,662 to 2,990 sq ft) put a shop on the ground floor and an office on the 1st floor. The 39 three-storey units (4,205 to 6,663 sq ft) add a second office floor. They fill Blocks A and F and the ends of the other rows, and the corner units have glass corporate facades.": "Pilih saiz yang sesuai dengan perniagaan anda. 53 unit dua tingkat (2,662 hingga 2,990 kaki persegi) menempatkan kedai di tingkat bawah dan pejabat di tingkat 1. 39 unit tiga tingkat (4,205 hingga 6,663 kaki persegi) menambah satu lagi tingkat pejabat. Unit-unit ini memenuhi Blok A dan F serta hujung deretan yang lain, dan unit lot tepi mempunyai fasad korporat berkaca.",
"The design suits owners who want to use one floor and rent out the others. A private staircase leads from the ground floor to the office floor, every floor has its own TNB and water meters, and the three-storey units have two staircases. The shop floor has a high ceiling, at 3.6 m floor to floor, behind a column-free verandah and a glass shop-front door, with a roller shutter at the back. Rainwater harvesting is built in, and parking bays line every row, with 626 visitor car parks in all.": "Reka bentuknya sesuai untuk pemilik yang mahu menggunakan satu tingkat dan menyewakan tingkat lain. Tangga persendirian menghubungkan tingkat bawah ke tingkat pejabat, setiap tingkat mempunyai meter TNB dan meter air sendiri, dan unit tiga tingkat mempunyai dua tangga. Tingkat kedai bersiling tinggi, 3.6 m dari lantai ke lantai, di belakang beranda tanpa tiang dan pintu hadapan kedai berkaca, dengan pintu gulung di belakang. Sistem penuaian air hujan turut disediakan, dan petak letak kereta terdapat di sepanjang setiap deretan, dengan 626 petak letak kereta pelawat kesemuanya.",
"Oakland is an established business area. AEON Seremban 2 and NSK Trade City are about 2.3 km by road, Columbia Asia Hospital 1.5 km and the Seremban toll on the North–South Expressway 2.7 km, with KLIA about 48 km away. Car showrooms, the Yakult factory and state offices such as Jabatan Audit Negara are within 2 km, and the developer's sales gallery is at Oakland Square, a short walk away.": "Oakland ialah kawasan perniagaan yang sudah mantap. AEON Seremban 2 dan NSK Trade City kira-kira 2.3 km melalui jalan raya, Columbia Asia Hospital 1.5 km dan tol Seremban di Lebuhraya Utara–Selatan 2.7 km, manakala KLIA kira-kira 48 km. Bilik pameran kereta, kilang Yakult dan pejabat kerajaan seperti Jabatan Audit Negara terletak dalam lingkungan 2 km, dan galeri jualan pemaju berada di Oakland Square, hanya beberapa langkah dari sini.",
"4.53 Acres": "4.53 Ekar",
"Oakland Ninety2 is Phase 4G, the final plot of DutaLand's Oakland commercial area in Seremban. The freehold site of 4.53 acres (Lots PT3258 and PT3259, Mukim Pekan Bukit Kepayang) lies on the south side of Jalan Haruan 5/9, opposite Oakland Square, with a lake along its west side.<0/> <1/> The site plan has 92 shop offices with individual commercial titles in nine blocks, A to J (there is no Block I). 53 units are two-storey and 39 are three-storey: Blocks A and F are three-storey throughout, and the other rows have three-storey units at their ends. Parking bays line every row, with 626 visitor car parks in total.<2/> <3/> The project was launched in the first quarter of 2024 with an estimated gross development value of RM110.0 million. DutaLand reported 48% of the units sold by 30 June 2024 and 79% in its 2025 annual report.<4/> <5/> Construction is under way. The developer's progress photos show earthworks in April 2024, piling in December 2024 and the structural frame in May 2025. No completion date has been published, so ask the developer's sales representative for the latest progress and handover timing.": "Oakland Ninety2 ialah Fasa 4G, plot terakhir kawasan komersial Oakland milik DutaLand di Seremban. Tapak pegangan bebas seluas 4.53 ekar (Lot PT3258 dan PT3259, Mukim Pekan Bukit Kepayang) terletak di sebelah selatan Jalan Haruan 5/9, bertentangan Oakland Square, dengan tasik di sepanjang sebelah baratnya.<0/> <1/> Pelan tapak mengandungi 92 kedai pejabat dengan hakmilik komersial individu dalam sembilan blok, A hingga J (tiada Blok I). 53 unit dua tingkat dan 39 unit tiga tingkat: Blok A dan F semuanya tiga tingkat, manakala deretan lain mempunyai unit tiga tingkat di hujungnya. Petak letak kereta terdapat di sepanjang setiap deretan, dengan 626 petak letak kereta pelawat kesemuanya.<2/> <3/> Projek ini dilancarkan pada suku pertama 2024 dengan anggaran nilai pembangunan kasar RM110.0 juta. DutaLand melaporkan 48% unit telah dijual setakat 30 Jun 2024 dan 79% dalam laporan tahunan 2025.<4/> <5/> Pembinaan sedang berjalan. Gambar kemajuan pemaju menunjukkan kerja tanah pada April 2024, kerja cerucuk pada Disember 2024 dan struktur rangka pada Mei 2025. Tarikh siap belum diumumkan, jadi tanya wakil jualan pemaju untuk kemajuan terkini dan jangkaan tarikh penyerahan.",
