"Oakland Ninety2 is developed by Oakland Holdings Sdn. Bhd. (198401008346 / 120863-A), a wholly owned subsidiary of DutaLand Berhad. DutaLand has been listed on Bursa Malaysia since 1973 and was known as Mycom Berhad until 2007. Its business covers property development, commodity trading and oil palm plantations, with property development its main earnings driver.": "Oakland Ninety2 dibangunkan oleh Oakland Holdings Sdn. Bhd. (198401008346 / 120863-A), anak syarikat milik penuh DutaLand Berhad. DutaLand tersenarai di Bursa Malaysia sejak 1973 dan dikenali sebagai Mycom Berhad sehingga 2007. Perniagaannya merangkumi pembangunan hartanah, perdagangan komoditi dan perladangan kelapa sawit, dengan pembangunan hartanah sebagai penyumbang utama pendapatan.",
"DutaLand took control of Oakland Holdings in the early 1990s, and the company has since developed Oakland, a commercial area of shop offices on the Seremban side of the North–South Expressway. Its previous phase, Oakland Square (Phase 4F, 182 shops and offices), was completed in the fourth quarter of 2019 across Jalan Haruan 5/9. Oakland Ninety2 (Phase 4G) is the final plot of the area. In Kuala Lumpur, DutaLand's projects include KH Villa in Sri Hartamas.": "DutaLand mengambil alih kawalan Oakland Holdings pada awal 1990-an, dan sejak itu syarikat ini membangunkan Oakland, kawasan komersial kedai pejabat di sebelah Seremban Lebuhraya Utara–Selatan. Fasa sebelumnya, Oakland Square (Fasa 4F, 182 kedai dan pejabat), siap pada suku keempat 2019 di seberang Jalan Haruan 5/9. Oakland Ninety2 (Fasa 4G) ialah plot terakhir kawasan ini. Di Kuala Lumpur, projek DutaLand termasuk KH Villa di Sri Hartamas.",
