"About Oakland Square": "Tentang Oakland Square",
"Oakland Square is a freehold commercial development of 86 retail shops and 96 strata offices on 7.5 acres in Seremban, completed in the fourth quarter of 2019. It is built around a covered central boulevard, which the developer describes as the first boulevard concept in Seremban 2. The development sits in DutaLand's Oakland commercial area off Jalan Haruan 1, beside the North-South Expressway and next to the Seremban 2 township.": "Oakland Square ialah pembangunan komersial pegangan bebas dengan 86 kedai runcit dan 96 pejabat strata di atas tanah seluas 7.5 ekar di Seremban, yang siap pada suku keempat 2019. Ia dibina mengelilingi boulevard tengah berbumbung, yang disifatkan pemaju sebagai konsep boulevard pertama di Seremban 2. Pembangunan ini terletak di kawasan komersial Oakland milik DutaLand di Jalan Haruan 1, bersebelahan Lebuhraya Utara-Selatan dan perbandaran Seremban 2.",
"The retail shops occupy the ground and first floors and open onto the boulevard. They range from about 1,041 to 2,119 sq ft; corner shops have frontage on three sides and intermediate shops on two, and the column-free spaces suit F&amp;B, lifestyle and service businesses. The strata offices on the upper floors range from about 1,120 to 2,718 sq ft, and some third-floor offices come with their own flat roof. They are open-plan suites with high ceilings and large windows, suitable for professional practices, regional offices and training or education centres.": "Kedai runcit menempati tingkat bawah dan tingkat satu, dan dibuka terus ke boulevard. Saiznya antara kira-kira 1,041 hingga 2,119 kaki persegi; kedai lot tepi mempunyai muka hadapan di tiga sisi dan kedai lot tengah di dua sisi, dan ruang tanpa tiang sesuai untuk perniagaan F&amp;B, gaya hidup dan perkhidmatan. Pejabat strata di tingkat atas pula antara kira-kira 1,120 hingga 2,718 kaki persegi, dan sesetengah pejabat di tingkat tiga dilengkapi bumbung rata sendiri. Ia merupakan suite pelan terbuka dengan siling tinggi dan tingkap besar, sesuai untuk amalan profesional, pejabat serantau serta pusat latihan atau pendidikan.",
"Getting there is simple for staff and customers. The North-South Expressway is about 2.3 km away and Jalan Lingkaran Tengah about 2 km, and KLIA is about 40 km away. NSK Trade City is about 700 m away, AEON Seremban 2 about 1.8 km and Columbia Asia Hospital about 1.2 km. Government offices, including the Seremban district police headquarters and the court complex, are about 1.8 km away.": "Mudah untuk kakitangan dan pelanggan datang. Lebuhraya Utara-Selatan kira-kira 2.3 km dan Jalan Lingkaran Tengah kira-kira 2 km, manakala KLIA kira-kira 40 km. NSK Trade City kira-kira 700 m, AEON Seremban 2 kira-kira 1.8 km dan Columbia Asia Hospital kira-kira 1.2 km. Pejabat kerajaan, termasuk Ibu Pejabat Polis Daerah Seremban dan kompleks mahkamah, kira-kira 1.8 km.",
"Oakland Square is already a working address. The developer reports about 92% of the shops and 85% of the offices occupied (January 2026), with tenants that include restaurants, cafés, beauty and wellness studios, offices and King's International School. It has 407 car parks, including 245 in the basement, 25 lifts and 24-hour security. Because the development is completed, buyers can view the actual premises before committing, with appointments arranged by the developer's sales representative.": "Oakland Square sudah pun menjadi alamat perniagaan yang aktif. Pemaju melaporkan kira-kira 92% kedai dan 85% pejabat telah diduduki (Januari 2026), dengan penyewa termasuk restoran, kafe, studio kecantikan dan kesejahteraan, pejabat serta King's International School. Terdapat 407 petak letak kereta, termasuk 245 di aras bawah tanah, 25 lif dan kawalan keselamatan 24 jam. Oleh kerana pembangunan ini sudah siap, pembeli boleh melihat premis sebenar sebelum membuat keputusan, dengan temu janji diatur oleh wakil jualan pemaju.",
"7.5 Acres": "7.5 Ekar",
"Oakland Square occupies a block between Jalan Haruan 5/8 and Jalan Haruan 5/9 in the Oakland commercial area of Seremban, with Jalan Haruan 1 at its western end. The freehold development stands on 7.5 acres and was completed in the fourth quarter of 2019 as Phase 4F of Oakland's commercial centre. Its neighbour to the south, Oakland Ninety2, is a separate final phase of individual-title shop offices.<0/> <1/> The complex holds 182 strata units in two blocks. Block A has four storeys with 112 units and Block B five storeys with 70 units; shops take the ground and first floors (86 units) and offices the floors above (96 units). The blocks are arranged around a covered central boulevard that links the retail frontages and the offices, so visitors can walk between shops and offices under cover.<2/> <3/> The development has 407 car parks: 245 private bays in the basement and 162 open bays. The offices are served by 25 lifts, security operates around the clock, and there is an open rooftop terrace. The boulevard doubles as open space for bazaars and weekend events, which helps bring visitors to the ground-floor shops.": "Oakland Square menempati satu blok di antara Jalan Haruan 5/8 dan Jalan Haruan 5/9 di kawasan komersial Oakland, Seremban, dengan Jalan Haruan 1 di hujung baratnya. Pembangunan pegangan bebas ini berdiri di atas tanah seluas 7.5 ekar dan siap pada suku keempat 2019 sebagai Fasa 4F pusat komersial Oakland. Jirannya di sebelah selatan, Oakland Ninety2, ialah fasa terakhir yang berasingan, terdiri daripada kedai pejabat berhakmilik individu.<0/> <1/> Kompleks ini mempunyai 182 unit strata dalam dua blok. Blok A empat tingkat dengan 112 unit dan Blok B lima tingkat dengan 70 unit; kedai di tingkat bawah dan tingkat satu (86 unit) dan pejabat di tingkat atas (96 unit). Blok-blok ini disusun mengelilingi boulevard tengah berbumbung yang menghubungkan deretan kedai dan pejabat, jadi pengunjung boleh berjalan antara kedai dan pejabat tanpa terdedah kepada panas dan hujan.<2/> <3/> Pembangunan ini mempunyai 407 petak letak kereta: 245 petak persendirian di aras bawah tanah dan 162 petak terbuka. Pejabat dilayani oleh 25 lif, kawalan keselamatan beroperasi sepanjang masa, dan terdapat teres bumbung terbuka. Boulevard ini juga berfungsi sebagai ruang terbuka untuk bazar dan acara hujung minggu, sekali gus membantu menarik pengunjung ke kedai di tingkat bawah.",
