"Oakland Square was developed by Oakland Holdings Sdn Bhd, a wholly owned subsidiary of DutaLand Berhad. DutaLand has been listed on Bursa Malaysia since 1973 and was known as Mycom Berhad until 2007. Its business covers property development, commodity trading and oil palm plantations, with property development its main earnings driver.": "Oakland Square dibangunkan oleh Oakland Holdings Sdn Bhd, anak syarikat milik penuh DutaLand Berhad. DutaLand tersenarai di Bursa Malaysia sejak 1973 dan dikenali sebagai Mycom Berhad sehingga 2007. Perniagaannya merangkumi pembangunan hartanah, perdagangan komoditi dan perladangan kelapa sawit, dengan pembangunan hartanah sebagai penyumbang utama pendapatan.",
"DutaLand took control of Oakland Holdings in the early 1990s, and the company has since developed Oakland, a commercial area of shop offices on the Seremban side of the North-South Expressway. Oakland Square is Phase 4F of this area and was completed in the fourth quarter of 2019. The final phase, Oakland Ninety2, is a row of 92 freehold shop offices now under construction on the adjacent plot. In Kuala Lumpur, DutaLand's projects include KH Villa in Sri Hartamas.": "DutaLand mengambil alih kawalan Oakland Holdings pada awal 1990-an, dan sejak itu syarikat ini membangunkan Oakland, kawasan komersial kedai pejabat di sebelah Seremban Lebuhraya Utara-Selatan. Oakland Square ialah Fasa 4F kawasan ini dan siap pada suku keempat 2019. Fasa terakhir, Oakland Ninety2, ialah sederet 92 kedai pejabat pegangan bebas yang kini dalam pembinaan di plot bersebelahan. Di Kuala Lumpur, projek DutaLand termasuk KH Villa di Sri Hartamas.",
