"About Sutera Suites @ KL City Gateway": "Tentang Sutera Suites @ KL City Gateway",
"Sutera Suites is the first launch at KL City Gateway, the transit-oriented masterplan by Sunsuria and Suezcap in Kampung Baru, Kuala Lumpur. The 46-storey tower stands beside LRT Kampung Baru and the Saloma Link, the pedestrian bridge that carries you over to Jalan Ampang and KLCC. The suites come fully furnished, start at 425 sq ft and are priced from RM575,000, giving buyers a city-centre address within walking distance of the Petronas Twin Towers.": "Sutera Suites ialah pelancaran pertama di KL City Gateway, pelan induk berorientasikan transit oleh Sunsuria dan Suezcap di Kampung Baru, Kuala Lumpur. Menara 46 tingkat ini terletak bersebelahan LRT Kampung Baru dan Saloma Link, jambatan pejalan kaki yang membawa anda ke Jalan Ampang dan KLCC. Suite-suite ini lengkap berperabot, bermula dari 425 kaki persegi dengan harga dari RM575,000, memberi pembeli alamat di pusat bandar, hanya berjalan kaki ke Menara Berkembar Petronas.",
"There are two studio layouts. Type A offers 425 sq ft, and Type A1, set in the corner positions, offers 450 sq ft. Each is one open room with its own bathroom, so the space can be arranged for sleeping, working and relaxing without walls in the way. Suites face either north toward Genting or south toward the KL skyline. The layouts suit professionals who need a base in the city, owners who spend part of the week in Kuala Lumpur, and buyers who plan to let the suite. Under a memorandum of understanding signed in July 2026, Maple Hospitality Group is set to manage Sutera Suites under its MapleSuites brand.": "Terdapat dua susun atur studio. Jenis A seluas 425 kaki persegi, dan Jenis A1 di kedudukan sudut seluas 450 kaki persegi. Setiap satu ialah ruang terbuka dengan bilik air sendiri, jadi ruang boleh diatur untuk tidur, bekerja dan berehat tanpa dinding yang menghalang. Suite menghadap sama ada ke utara ke arah Genting atau ke selatan ke arah latar langit KL. Susun atur ini sesuai untuk golongan profesional yang perlukan pangkalan di bandar, pemilik yang menghabiskan sebahagian minggu di Kuala Lumpur, dan pembeli yang bercadang menyewakan suite. Di bawah memorandum persefahaman yang ditandatangani pada Julai 2026, Maple Hospitality Group akan mengurus Sutera Suites di bawah jenama MapleSuites.",
"Getting around is the main draw. LRT Kampung Baru is about a five-minute walk away, one stop from KLCC and four from KL Sentral, where the KLIA Ekspres departs. The Saloma Link is around 300 m from the tower, and Suria KLCC is about 15 minutes on foot. MRT Raja Uda on the Putrajaya Line is a 13-minute walk, and the National Heart Institute is around 2 km by road. The developer also plans dedicated ramps to and from the AKLEH, subject to approval.": "Kemudahan bergerak ialah tarikan utama. LRT Kampung Baru kira-kira lima minit berjalan kaki, satu stesen dari KLCC dan empat dari KL Sentral, tempat KLIA Ekspres berlepas. Saloma Link kira-kira 300 m dari menara, dan Suria KLCC kira-kira 15 minit berjalan kaki. MRT Raja Uda di Laluan Putrajaya hanya 13 minit berjalan kaki, dan Institut Jantung Negara kira-kira 2 km melalui jalan raya. Pemaju juga merancang susur khas masuk dan keluar AKLEH, tertakluk kepada kelulusan.",
"Facilities are spread across three floors. The Level 8 podium has a swimming pool, leisure, jacuzzi and kids' pools, a pool deck, a gym, a pickleball court in the multipurpose hall, a BBQ pavilion, a garden trail, a nursery and a prayer zone. Level 41 holds the Sky Business Lounge with a sky terrace and business suite, and Level 43 is the Sky Entertainment Hub. A hotel-style reception welcomes guests, and street-front retail sits at the base of the tower.": "Kemudahan terletak di tiga tingkat. Podium Tingkat 8 menempatkan kolam renang, kolam santai, jakuzi dan kolam kanak-kanak, dek kolam, gimnasium, gelanggang pickleball di dewan serba guna, pavilion BBQ, laluan taman, taska dan ruang solat. Tingkat 41 menempatkan Sky Business Lounge dengan teres langit dan suite perniagaan, manakala Tingkat 43 ialah Sky Entertainment Hub. Kaunter penyambut tetamu gaya hotel menyambut kedatangan tetamu, dan ruang runcit di aras jalan terletak di kaki menara.",
"Sutera Suites suits buyers who want a furnished suite in central Kuala Lumpur with rail and KLCC within walking distance. It is a leasehold development, and completion is expected in 2030.": "Sutera Suites sesuai untuk pembeli yang mahukan suite berperabot di tengah Kuala Lumpur, dengan stesen rel dan KLCC dalam jarak berjalan kaki. Ia pembangunan pegangan pajakan dan dijangka siap pada 2030.",
"7.95 Acres": "7.95 Ekar",
"KL City Gateway is a transit-oriented development on 9.66 acres along Jalan Sungai Baru, Kampung Baru, across the AKLEH from KLCC. Sutera Suites is the first launch in its 7.95-acre Phase 1, which is planned for serviced suites, residences, offices, retail and public space.<0/> <1/> Sutera is a 46-storey tower at the western end of the site, beside the Saloma Link and LRT Kampung Baru. It has street-front retail at its base and facilities on Levels 8, 41 and 43. Later towers are planned further east.": "KL City Gateway ialah pembangunan berorientasikan transit seluas 9.66 ekar di sepanjang Jalan Sungai Baru, Kampung Baru, bertentangan dengan KLCC di seberang AKLEH. Sutera Suites ialah pelancaran pertama dalam Fasa 1 seluas 7.95 ekar, yang dirancang untuk suite servis, kediaman, pejabat, runcit dan ruang awam.<0/> <1/> Sutera ialah menara 46 tingkat di hujung barat tapak, bersebelahan Saloma Link dan LRT Kampung Baru. Di kakinya terdapat ruang runcit di aras jalan, dan kemudahan di Tingkat 8, 41 dan 43. Menara seterusnya dirancang lebih ke timur.",
