"PFA Land Sdn Bhd (Co. No. 201401024459 / 1100547-T) is a licensed housing developer within Homecity Group, operating from the group's office at Kajang Prima, Selangor. Taman Ara Bayu 2 in Mantin is its current residential development, delivered under a developer licence issued by the Ministry of Housing and Local Government.": "PFA Land Sdn Bhd (No. Syarikat 201401024459 / 1100547-T) ialah pemaju perumahan berlesen dalam Homecity Group, beroperasi dari pejabat kumpulan di Kajang Prima, Selangor. Taman Ara Bayu 2 di Mantin ialah pembangunan kediamannya ketika ini, dibangunkan di bawah lesen pemaju yang dikeluarkan oleh Kementerian Pembangunan Kerajaan Tempatan.",
"Homecity Group has been building in the Kajang–Semenyih corridor since 2001 and is ISO 9001 certified, with a StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) recognition and a Sin Chew Business Excellence Award in 2020. In Mantin, sister company Homecity Realty completed Taman Ara Bayu, a 97-home terrace scheme that received its Certificate of Completion and Compliance in January 2025 — the same neighbourhood name that Taman Ara Bayu 2 now continues.": "Homecity Group telah membina di koridor Kajang–Semenyih sejak 2001 dan memiliki pensijilan ISO 9001, dengan pengiktirafan StarProperty Awards 2021 Starter Home (Landed Excellence) dan Sin Chew Business Excellence Award pada 2020. Di Mantin, syarikat bersekutu Homecity Realty telah menyiapkan Taman Ara Bayu, skim 97 rumah teres yang menerima Perakuan Siap dan Pematuhan pada Januari 2025 — nama kejiranan yang kini diteruskan oleh Taman Ara Bayu 2.",
