"Windsor Homes Sdn. Bhd. is an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Multifield International Holdings Limited, a Hong Kong property group founded in the early 1980s and listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange since 1998, with offices in Hong Kong, Shanghai, Zhuhai and Kuala Lumpur. The group develops, invests in and manages residential and commercial property, and has operated in Malaysia since 2018 under the Windsor Land and Windsor Collection brands.": "Windsor Homes Sdn. Bhd. ialah anak syarikat milik penuh secara tidak langsung Multifield International Holdings Limited, kumpulan hartanah Hong Kong yang ditubuhkan pada awal 1980-an dan tersenarai di Bursa Saham Hong Kong sejak 1998, dengan pejabat di Hong Kong, Shanghai, Zhuhai dan Kuala Lumpur. Kumpulan ini membangunkan, melabur dalam dan mengurus hartanah kediaman serta komersial, dan beroperasi di Malaysia sejak 2018 di bawah jenama Windsor Land dan Windsor Collection.",
"The Windsor name is carried by the group's completed residential projects in Shanghai, including Windsor Court and Windsor Place, and in Malaysia by ALAIA Titiwangsa, a serviced residence in Kuala Lumpur due for completion in late 2026. Windsor Villa is the group's first landed development and its flagship in Malaysia, on a 55-acre freehold parcel in Cyberjaya acquired in 2024.": "Nama Windsor dibawa oleh projek kediaman kumpulan yang telah siap di Shanghai, termasuk Windsor Court dan Windsor Place, dan di Malaysia oleh ALAIA Titiwangsa, kediaman servis di Kuala Lumpur yang dijangka siap pada akhir 2026. Windsor Villa ialah pembangunan rumah bertanah pertama kumpulan ini dan projek utamanya di Malaysia, di atas tanah pegangan bebas seluas 55 ekar di Cyberjaya yang diperoleh pada 2024.",
