"Submit an e-Enquiry on your preferred unit, complete the purchase journey, and unlock exclusive e-Enquiry rewards after SPA completion.": "Hantar e-⁠Enquiry untuk unit pilihan anda, selesaikan pembelian, dan nikmati ganjaran eksklusif e-⁠Enquiry selepas SPA ditandatangani.",
