"Harmoni 1 is the shop-office component of Ancubic Harmoni City, a 33-acre leasehold township in Kuala Langat, Selangor, beside Bandar Rimbayu, Tropicana Aman and Eco Sanctuary. It occupies 4.66 acres near the Rimbayu roundabout, with Persiaran Rimbayu along its east side.<0/> <1/> Its 46 strata shop offices stand in two rows around a landscaped walkway: Row 1 (lots 1–23) faces Parcel 2 and Row 2 (lots 23A–46) faces Persiaran Rimbayu. Serviced apartments are planned on the neighbouring parcels, and completion is estimated for Q2 2029.": "Harmoni 1 ialah komponen kedai pejabat Ancubic Harmoni City, sebuah perbandaran pajakan seluas 33 ekar di Kuala Langat, Selangor, bersebelahan Bandar Rimbayu, Tropicana Aman dan Eco Sanctuary. Ia terletak di atas tanah seluas 4.66 ekar berhampiran bulatan Rimbayu, dengan Persiaran Rimbayu di sebelah timurnya.<0/> <1/> 46 unit kedai pejabat stratanya tersusun dalam dua baris di sekeliling laluan pejalan kaki berlandskap: Baris 1 (lot 1–23) menghadap Parsel 2 dan Baris 2 (lot 23A–46) menghadap Persiaran Rimbayu. Pangsapuri servis dirancang di parsel bersebelahan, dan dijangka siap pada suku kedua 2029.",
